gobeproductive (1.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * VitruvianOS again, with everything since 0.2.1: the whole suite as
    1.0.0 finished it (3D charts, the image plug-ins and GIMP filters),
    1.0.1's fixes, and 1.0.2's.
  * Saving is safe: a new file replaces the old one only once it is
    written and reads back; permissions, attributes and links are kept.
  * Damaged or crafted documents, Excel, Word, HTML, SYLK and CSV files
    no longer crash the app; installing the original can no longer write
    outside its folder.
  * COUNTIF and SUMIF read ">=", "<=" and "<>"; SUBSTITUTE no longer
    hangs; large CSV and SYLK files import in a moment.

 -- Ian <idumych@gmail.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:00:00 -0800

